# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# notch.sm -- A plate with a notch in a corner of its datum edge
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The edge at y = 0 stops at x = 60, and a hole near the far side gets
# its ordinate there; the datum ordinate on that side starts at x = 60.
sheet 2 1 0.44
plate p 0 0 100 50 at 0 0 0 axes +x +y
cut cut1 60 -1 101 20 along z
hole hole1 4 90 40 along z
